meta {
  name: Get unknown paste
  type: http
  seq: 7
  tags: [
    smoke
  ]
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/pastes/:id
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:path {
  @description('''Well-formed and 22 characters, but never issued.''')
  id: zzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzz
}

assert {
  res.status: 404
}

docs {
  An id that is shaped correctly but was never issued. Same bare 404 as a burned paste
  and an expired one — see "Burn paste - second read is gone" for why they are
  indistinguishable on purpose.

  Guessing your way to a paste is not realistic anyway: the id is 128 bits.
}
